{"id":"wb-7-1080","name":"惠安青山宫","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"惠安青山宫","text":"惠安青山宫，位于中国福建省泉州市惠安县山霞镇青山村，为山神、王爷信仰庙宇，主祀泉州三邑的乡土神灵青山灵安尊王。2001年1月20日公布为第五批福建省文物保护单位。2013年3月5日公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%83%A0%E5%AE%89%E9%9D%92%E5%B1%B1%E5%AE%AB","revisionId":86761391,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86761391","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d298970fe7967d9064c85654.jpg","title":"福建省惠安県の青山宮.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%A6%8F%E5%BB%BA%E7%9C%81%E6%83%A0%E5%AE%89%E7%9C%8C%E3%81%AE%E9%9D%92%E5%B1%B1%E5%AE%AE.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/06/%E7%A6%8F%E5%BB%BA%E7%9C%81%E6%83%A0%E5%AE%89%E7%9C%8C%E3%81%AE%E9%9D%92%E5%B1%B1%E5%AE%AE.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Allervous","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​位於中華人民共和國福建省惠安縣的惠安青山宫，主祀青山靈安尊王。","width":320,"height":240}}